<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48373" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θερά̆π-ευμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a service done to another</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. θεοῦ</span> divine <i>worship</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Def.</u>
				415a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>service paid</i> to a person, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξενικὰ θ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					718b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1117c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>care</i> of the body, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				524b
			</span></i> (pl.); of a child, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hyps.Fr.</u>
				3(1)
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				 ii 12
			</span></i> (lyr., pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>surgical treatment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mochl.</u>
				40
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1181b3
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀσκλαπιοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					4.952.96
				</span></i>
			 (Epid.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			concrete, <i>preparations, drugs</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				4.34
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
